{
  "info": {
    "name": "Schedule API",
    "_postman_id": "schedule-collection",
    "description": "Full test suite for GET /schedule and PATCH /schedule/:dayOfWeek.\n\n## Setup\n1. Run **[AUTH] Login as Barber** first — auto-sets `{{token}}`.\n2. All subsequent requests use that token automatically.\n\n## Variables\n| Variable | Set by |\n|---|---|\n| `baseUrl` | Collection variable (default: http://localhost:3001) |\n| `token` | Auto-set after barber login |\n| `clientToken` | Auto-set after client login (used in 403 tests) |\n\n## Day of week reference\n| Value | Day |\n|---|---|\n| 0 | Sunday |\n| 1 | Monday |\n| 2 | Tuesday |\n| 3 | Wednesday |\n| 4 | Thursday |\n| 5 | Friday |\n| 6 | Saturday |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "clientToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[AUTH] Login as Barber",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Has access_token', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('token captured', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('token')).to.not.be.empty);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"barber@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"YourPassword123!\",\n  \"role\": \"barber\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "[AUTH] Login as Client",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('clientToken', json.access_token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('clientToken captured', () => pm.expect(pm.collectionVariables.get('clientToken')).to.not.be.empty);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"client@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"YourPassword123!\",\n  \"role\": \"client\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "✅ Happy Path",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. GET /schedule — all 7 days",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('success = true', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('data is array of 7', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('array').with.lengthOf(7);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('days 0-6 all present', () => {",
                  "  const days = json.data.map(d => d.dayOfWeek).sort((a,b) => a - b);",
                  "  pm.expect(days).to.deep.equal([0,1,2,3,4,5,6]);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('each row has required fields', () => {",
                  "  json.data.forEach(d => {",
                  "    pm.expect(d).to.have.all.keys(",
                  "      'id','barberId','dayOfWeek','isWorking','regularStartTime',",
                  "      'regularEndTime','slotDurationMinutes','afterHoursEnabled',",
                  "      'afterHoursStart','afterHoursEnd','dayOffBookingEnabled',",
                  "      'dayOffStartTime','dayOffEndTime','advanceNoticeMinutes',",
                  "      'createdAt','updatedAt'",
                  "    );",
                  "  });",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/schedule",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["schedule"]
            }
          }
        },
